# dgientco

## Stack

- Nuxt 4 and Vue 3. Only `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Routes live in `app/pages/`. Components live in `app/components/` and are auto-imported.
- News and legal copy come from `content/` via `@nuxt/content` collections. Other lists live in `app/data/*.ts`.
- Images use `AppImage` with width, height, and lazy loading.
- Static output with `nuxt generate`.

## RTL

The site is fully right-to-left (`lang=fa` and `dir=rtl` on `html`). Logical properties only.

```html
<!-- bad -->
<div class="ml-4 pl-6 text-left left-0">
<!-- good -->
<div class="ms-4 ps-6 text-start start-0">
```

`left`, `right`, `ml`, `mr`, `pl`, `pr`, `text-left`, and `text-right` are forbidden.

## Design

Campus layout mirrored for RTL. Do not invent a second visual system.

- Header is `bg-primary`, height `h-24`, wordmark, uppercase nav, contact as a white pill.
- Hero is start-aligned from `lg`, centered below that. The title uses `.hero-gradient`. Stats sit in a glass bar. The hero uses `min-height` so the title does not overlap the stats.
- Header contact is a secondary `rounded-lg` button. Buttons are `rounded-lg`, not pills.
- Section rhythm is `py-8`. Titles use `.section-title` and `.page-title`. Container is `max-w-7xl`.
- Colours: primary `#1c1917`, accent blue `#024a70`, muted `#f5f5f4`, border `#e7e5e4`, warm fill `#fff7ed`, blue fill `#eff6ff`.
- Type is Vazirmatn. The woff2 files live in `public/fonts/` and are declared in `app/assets/css/fonts.css`.
- Display dates are Jalali with Persian digits (`formatJalaliDate`). Keep dates as ISO in content.

## Content and SEO

- Every page calls `usePageSeo` with a Persian title and description and `ogLocale: fa_IR`.
- There is no programs section and no events section. Do not link to `/programs` or `/events`.
